[
  {
    "day": 1,
    "title": "I. How the prayers connect",
    "pdfName": "Day-01.pdf",
    "file": "Day-01.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 2,
    "title": "On behalf of the (2nd–5th / 6th–20th) generation… I agree WE are guilty.",
    "pdfName": "Day-02.pdf",
    "file": "Day-02.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 3,
    "title": "I agree that WE made it more important than God, loved it more than God, and preferred it instead of God.",
    "pdfName": "Day-03.pdf",
    "file": "Day-03.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 4,
    "title": "For this idolatry, adultery, and rebellion, I lay my life / my bloodline on the altar of God.",
    "pdfName": "Day-04.pdf",
    "file": "Day-04.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 5,
    "title": "I recognize that this is happening because of agreements, blood covenants, blood contracts, hexes, vexes, interaction with the blood, and satanic ritual agreements… because of [fruit] with the parent [Principality].",
    "pdfName": "Day-05.pdf",
    "file": "Day-05.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 6,
    "title": "For the accusation of this record, I lay down the 2nd–5th / 6th–20th generations (Round 1: mother's side, father's side, all the way back to Adam).",
    "pdfName": "Day-06.pdf",
    "file": "Day-06.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 7,
    "title": "I refuse to blame anyone anymore… I take accountability for what my bloodline copied… AND FORGIVE everyone who taught us.",
    "pdfName": "Day-07.pdf",
    "file": "Day-07.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 8,
    "title": "If people from other bloodlines have repented and we don't know about it, I STILL… forgive every way we remembered people the way Jesus doesn't.",
    "pdfName": "Day-08.pdf",
    "file": "Day-08.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 9,
    "title": "Representing my bloodline, I forgive them for not capturing every vain imagination and bringing it to Jesus as given in 2 Corinthians 10:3-5.",
    "pdfName": "Day-09.pdf",
    "file": "Day-09.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 10,
    "title": "…and not warring against people as given in Ephesians 6:12.",
    "pdfName": "Day-10.pdf",
    "file": "Day-10.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 11,
    "title": "I ask You Father to forgive my bloodline since I have forgiven other bloodlines. I ask You to judge between me and them so that the judgment is pure and holy.",
    "pdfName": "Day-11.pdf",
    "file": "Day-11.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 12,
    "title": "I no longer want to serve [topic] or [fruit]. I am asking for the forgiveness of God on this and for the Blood of Jesus to cover the record and speak instead.",
    "pdfName": "Day-12.pdf",
    "file": "Day-12.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 13,
    "title": "I also ask for a spiritual decree of divorce from this record. We don't have room in my bloodline for unconfessed records.",
    "pdfName": "Day-13.pdf",
    "file": "Day-13.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 14,
    "title": "I cast off of my head the crown of iniquity that had been attached to my head. You are banned from my life, my mind, my heart, and my body.",
    "pdfName": "Day-14.pdf",
    "file": "Day-14.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 15,
    "title": "Give me courage to be responsible for every other temptation and accusation… so that he no longer has any more open accusations against me. I thank You for the people You have put in my life to help me walk out a life of repentance, because of walking in discipleship.",
    "pdfName": "Day-15.pdf",
    "file": "Day-15.pdf"
  },
  {
    "day": 16,
    "title": "In the name of Jesus, Amen.",
    "pdfName": "Day-16.pdf",
    "file": "Day-16.pdf"
  },
